1
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:41,840
The Midgard Serpent died with a deafening
roar.

2
00:00:42,140 --> 00:00:44,740
The overpowering danger had been averted.

3
00:00:44,960 --> 00:00:47,040
Together, we had achieved

4
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,560
what the gods had been unable to
accomplish.

5
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:51,180
We had won.

6
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:53,560
The gates of Asgard reopened.

7
00:00:53,740 --> 00:00:56,260
A golden light streamed from the fortress

8
00:00:56,340 --> 00:00:58,800
and penetrated the serpent's eternal
night.

9
00:00:58,920 --> 00:01:02,380
The shadow that had already begun to cover
the world dispersed,

10
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:06,440
and all that had withered and been
poisoned was now blossoming.

11
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,360
For a moment, the four great cultures of
the West

12
00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,960
had come a little closer

13
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:15,360
and united to ward off the downfall of the
world.

14
00:01:15,360 --> 00:01:17,280
Only the future would show

15
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:20,240
what our newfound friendships would bring.
